description: Apache license header required on MONAI Python source files
globs: monai/**/*.py,tests/**/*.py
alwaysApply: false
---

# License header

Every `.py` file under `monai/` and `tests/` opens with the verbatim Apache block — see `CONTRIBUTING.md` → "Licensing information".

- Copy it from a neighboring file rather than retyping it. No year, no author name, no rewrapping.
- The license hook (`.cursor/hooks/require-license-header.sh`) inserts it on new files and owns the canonical text. If it fires, leave its output alone.
